{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2509;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\b\f0\fs20 Fading Sands\b0\par
\fs16\par
In the mystical Fading Sands desert the sands rise and fall much like the ocean tides - and at the moment, they are about to recede to the bottomless chasms below. No one knows why this happens, but the clonks do know one thing: they only have a few moments left to dig or drill oil from the plentiful oil reserves hidden beneath the sands.\par
\par
The goal is to bank 300 money points.\par
